    "Illegal/unrecognized/void unions REMAIN ATTEMPTABLE (spec fixed rule). Recognition only changes social/legal consequences, never eligibility.",
    "Ledger references use frozen M2 ledger categories/occurrence keys (A confirms exact category names at freeze).",
